1
00:00:00,594 --> 00:00:01,824
(Sheldon:)What are you doing here?

2
00:00:01,996 --> 00:00:05,156
(Stuart:)Um, Raj invited me to go to the movies
with you guys.

3
00:00:05,332 --> 00:00:10,202
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, I didn't authorize this.

4
00:00:11,739 --> 00:00:15,009
- Sheldon, you are not in charge.
- That's mighty sassy for a man...

5
00:00:15,175 --> 00:00:17,975
(Sheldon:)...with a roommate performance review
around the corner.

6
00:00:18,912 --> 00:00:21,312
(Raj:)What's the big deal?
You guys are bringing your girlfriends.

7
00:00:21,482 --> 00:00:22,852
I didn't wanna sit by myself.

8
00:00:23,017 --> 00:00:26,887
(Sheldon:)The big deal is, I was expecting us
to be an intimate group of five.

9
00:00:27,054 --> 00:00:30,354
Now we're gonna be
a faceless mass of six.

10
00:00:31,625 --> 00:00:34,325
(Leonard:)It'll be fine.
Just, uh, pretend he's Wolowitz.

11
00:00:35,396 --> 00:00:36,886
(Sheldon:)Hmm...

12
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:42,727
(Sheldon:)- Do you like Raisinets?
- I take them or leave them.

13
00:00:42,903 --> 00:00:44,993
(Sheldon:)At the movies,
Wolowitz always eats Raisinets.

14
00:00:45,172 --> 00:00:47,732
(Stuart:)Would you feel more comfortable
if I ate Raisinets?

15
00:00:47,908 --> 00:00:50,338
(Sheldon:)It's hardly my business what you eat.

16
00:00:50,511 --> 00:00:53,571
(Sheldon:)As long as it doesn't crunch
during the film and it's Raisinets.

17
00:00:55,582 --> 00:00:56,712
(Sheldon:)Okay.

18
00:00:56,884 --> 00:00:58,544
(Stuart:)- Should we go?
- Uh, one more question.

19
00:00:58,719 --> 00:01:01,209
If you're gonna replace Wolowitz,
I need to know a little more about you.

